^{:go/end 195} (go/func NewKeyFromSeed "NewKeyFromSeed calculates a private key from a seed. It will panic if\nlen(seed) is not [SeedSize]. This function is provided for interoperability\nwith RFC 8032. RFC 8032's private keys correspond to seeds in this\npackage.\n" ^PrivateKey [^{:tag (slice byte)} seed]
